  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "image": "books/G1/106/p06.jpg",
   "w": 1400,
   "h": 549,
   "text": "Fishing boat This is a fishing boat. It goes out to sea to catch fish. This boat has nets that go deep into the water. The boat comes back with nets full of fish.",
   "textBox": null,
   "wordBoxes": null,
   "audio": [
    29.62,
    32.46
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "image": "books/G1/106/p07.jpg",
   "w": 1400,
   "h": 549,
   "text": "Ferryboat Here is a ferryboat. Ferryboats carry people across the water. They take people to work, and they take them home again. A big ferryboat can carry cars and trucks, too.",
   "textBox": null,
   "wordBoxes": null,
   "audio": [
    33.5,
    43.5
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "image": "books/G1/106/p08.jpg",
   "w": 1400,
   "h": 549,
   "text": "Fireboat This is a fireboat. The fireboat helps put out fires on little boats and big ships. The boat sprays water at the fire.",
   "textBox": null,
   "wordBoxes": null,
   "audio": [
    44.86,
    56.71
   ]
  },
  {
